  "source_blob_sha": {
    "ko": "f537bf28431aceeb8e41ed1ecec3e9efa3ca31c2",
    "zh": "a645aef6c5a2515e51322d6b9b69047f5ac6c25e",
    "en": "d14318cac0f84def17a0a76b390a27ab076ebe8d"
  },
  "checked_rows": 14,
  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00007",
      "text": "乙. 处分机关认为违法行为系非故意的轻微疏忽所致时，",
      "source_hash": "6aee3a0452766b90d94af258213af7f038f35911e60ebe7bf503138f11ae8692",
      "target_id": "XML:2657262"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00008",
      "text": "可以减轻第二项具体标准规定的处分。此时，处分属于暂停业务的，",
      "source_hash": "b16296049745cc314103a644180a80b1abdb5b7a5e33284e6d883ae473e6b701",
      "target_id": "XML:2657263"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00009",
      "text": "可以在规定的暂停业务期限的二分之一范围内减轻；处分属于撤销指定的，",
      "source_hash": "2350552f0d69eaafa3b3d1e08bcad422c4b80e69bf96ca5156203239e36c5c85",
      "target_id": "XML:2657264"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00010",
      "text": "可以减轻为暂停业务六个月。",
      "source_hash": "89f32ab5c3f3b0189c6cc1c44e2fac2172bdc8d84ef4d864508edffd09fb34dc",
      "target_id": "XML:2657265"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00011",
      "text": "丙. 存在两项以上违法行为且各项处分标准不同时，适用其中较重的处分标准。",
      "source_hash": "1421fa9a392d16c946cdb9652d82c3eed479ffc893888f518e0fa4905a94810a",
      "target_id": "XML:2657266"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00012",
      "text": "但两项以上的处分标准均为暂停业务的，",
      "source_hash": "6b06549f763c6bae250f4a6a90cae8ae7cbe9f4a91d92cfd9a760a22bf1486bf",
      "target_id": "XML:2657267"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00013",
      "text": "可以在不超过各处分标准规定期限总和的范围内，",
      "source_hash": "7e95e9e07bf619eeea3390358efab62c0505765f97a9822538df01bbd3d2de2f",
      "target_id": "XML:2657268"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00014",
      "text": "在较重处分标准的二分之一幅度内加重处分。",
      "source_hash": "ce95f2f5e45038f7ff496adf4f9c5acc42a2eaaefd9b540cbf036a7492b9c9d1",
      "target_id": "XML:2657269"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00028",
      "text": "方式获得指定的情形",
      "source_hash": "2a589a2d13c086440d01f4e0dfb921224c0a5180f2b53049c6b2cba792689242",
      "target_id": "XML:2657284"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00039",
      "text": "1) 未能满足指定条件中的人员标准",
      "source_hash": "dfc30a9c8df3945a7afdb4171d41a60c20b0ce44ae177e89a321279a2629cb77",
      "target_id": "XML:2657295"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00043",
      "text": "的情形",
      "source_hash": "39c93dffba2bc48deba01f61f0194e577803699c5cdcd1ad3f8fc1c678b03bea",
      "target_id": "XML:2657299"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00046",
      "text": "2) 未能满足指定条件中的设施标准",
      "source_hash": "a06eb79961d837b33450332002ef6b2360eb4d2b76e77e71880348bb51c98486",
      "target_id": "XML:2657302"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00050",
      "text": "的情形",
      "source_hash": "39c93dffba2bc48deba01f61f0194e577803699c5cdcd1ad3f8fc1c678b03bea",
      "target_id": "XML:2657306"
    },
    {
      "id": "A36425-zh-00052",
      "text": "3个月",
      "source_hash": "811f2cac7e1b9971cc17f7c24b0901accc169353ffd0d4f84ed010480f253ba9",
      "target_id": "XML:2657308"
    }
  ],
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "note": "Annex 2 adjacent table cell corrections; preserve earlier progress. Full family is not COMPLETE."
}
